            "notes": "In round three, we will grab Optimal Overflow. This will allow you to heal your party while also sending additional orbs. Always make sure to keep track of the last orb you sent, so as to send extra healing orbs toward your team or extra damage orbs towards the enemy. And don't be stingy with the healing, using the healing as much as you can between orb throws is what makes this build so great and chaotic. At this point, you want to have Extendrils to increase the range of your orbs. If you have the money, get extra items to increase ability power.",
