            "notes": "Round 4 is when this build really kicks off, and you become an absolute menace to the enemy team. All that you get for this one is Cybervenom, which allows every damage orb to reduce the healing received by the enemy team and grants a small cooldown reduction for your orbs. If you are sending orbs and healing enough, you'll be sending tons of anti-healing damage to the enemy, which allows your team to effectively take them out. It also adds this to your ult, which is useful against the weaker enemies in your line of sight.",
