            "created_at": "2025-09-19T16:32:56.564568+00:00",
            "notes": "In Round 5, we will grab Phantasm, which will leave another orb where you fade away from. You can use this defensively or offensively. If you are being attacked by a Rein, just fire a damage orb, fade into his space, then attack from a distance behind him, and he will fall or go on the defensive. If your team is dying too fast, send a healing orb, fade in the middle of them, then heal them, which will send more healing orbs. As for items, the only one you should get is the Champions Kit to up the damage and healing even more.",
