            "notes": "At this point in the game, I tend to get Chain Grasp, which allows you to attack two enemies at once after you send out an orb. A good secondary power is Precarious Potency, which heals your allies more over time, allowing you to focus on sending damage orbs while healing your team. As for items, sell Smart Orbs; it is unnecessary to keep them when Liquid Nitrogen slows them down anyway, and buy either Iridescent Iris or Catalytic Crystal, depending on which one you don't have yet.",
